### ====================================================================
### LG Nature's Water — Authentication, RBAC & Security Test Suite
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/api/auth
### Works with: VS Code REST Client, Postman, Insomnia, or Bruno
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/auth

### 1. Login as Pre-Seeded Demo Station Operator
# @name operatorLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+639170000001",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login as Pre-Seeded Demo Rider (J. Cruz)
# @name riderLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+639170000002",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Login as Pre-Seeded Demo Customer (Maria Santos)
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+639170000003",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Register a New Customer (Auto-calculates Nearest Station + Sets Up 1-Click Profile)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Carlo Mendoza",
  "phoneNumber": "+639178889900",
  "password": "password123",
  "deliveryAddress": "18 Xavierville Ave, Loyola Heights, Quezon City",
  "latitude": 14.6401,
  "longitude": 121.0729,
  "defaultOrderQty": 8
}

### 5. Get Current Logged-In Profile (/me)
@operatorToken = {{operatorLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### 6. Provision a New Staff Account (RIDER or OPERATOR) — Requires OPERATOR Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Rico Blanco (Delivery Rider)",
  "phoneNumber": "+639175554433",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "RIDER"
}

### 7. Verify Operator-Only RBAC Route (Should return 200 for OPERATOR, 403 for CUSTOMER/RIDER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/verify/operator-only
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### 8. Ideathon 1-Click Demo Role Switcher (CUSTOMER | RIDER | OPERATOR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo-switch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "RIDER"
}

### 9. Refresh Access Token
@refreshToken = {{operatorLogin.response.body.refreshToken}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 10. Logout (Revokes Refresh Token in PostgreSQL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
